00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:14.040
Attention ! Résultat des courses

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:15.080
Nul à chier !

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:16.780
Excelleeeent

00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:21.960
